TI  - High-resolution mapping of grassland canopy cover in China through the integration of extensive drone imagery and satellite data
T2  - ISPRS JOURNAL OF PHOTOGRAMMETRY AND REMOTE SENSING
LA  - English
KW  - Grassland
KW  - Canopy cover
KW  - Drone imagery
