TI  - COMPARING UAV AND SATELLITES ACCURACY IN SIMULATING FINE-SCALE ALPINE GRASSLAND HETEROGENEITY IN PERIGLACIAL ENVIRONMENT
T2  - APPLIED ECOLOGY AND ENVIRONMENTAL RESEARCH
