TI  - Species classification using Unmanned Aerial Vehicle (UAV)-acquired high spatial resolution imagery in a heterogeneous grassland
T2  - ISPRS JOURNAL OF PHOTOGRAMMETRY AND REMOTE SENSING
LA  - English
