TI  - Different responses of spatial heterogeneity of grassland vegetation to grazing intensity in northern China
T2  - CHINESE SCIENCE BULLETIN-CHINESE
LA  - Chinese
KW  - grassland in northern China
KW  - long-term continuous grazing
KW  - grazing intensity
KW  - spatial heterogeneity
KW  - patch connectivity
KW  - patchness
KW  - POPULATION-DENSITY
