TI  - The relationship between species and spectral diversity in grassland communities is mediated by their vertical complexity
T2  - APPLIED VEGETATION SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - community scale
KW  - grasslands
KW  - height diversity
KW  - mixed-effect models
KW  - multi-spectral sensor
