TI  - Mapping InvasiveLupinus polyphyllusLindl. in Semi-natural Grasslands Using Object-Based Image Analysis of UAV-borne Images
T2  - PFG-JOURNAL OF PHOTOGRAMMETRY REMOTE SENSING AND GEOINFORMATION SCIENCE
LA  - English
