TI  - Estimation of Burned Fuel Volumes in Heathland Ecosystems Using Multitemporal UAV LiDAR and Superpixel Classification
T2  - DRONES
LA  - English
KW  - UAV LiDAR
KW  - fuel load
KW  - superpixel classification
