TI  - Cross-scale estimating of forage nitrogen in alpine grassland integrating UAV imagery and Sentinel-2 data
T2  - EUROPEAN JOURNAL OF AGRONOMY
LA  - English
KW  - Alpine grassland
KW  - Forage quality
