TI  - Monitoring invasive exotic grass species in ecological restoration areas of the Brazilian savanna using UAV images
T2  - REMOTE SENSING APPLICATIONS-SOCIETY AND ENVIRONMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Invasive exotic grasses
KW  - Machine learning
KW  - Savanna restoration
KW  - Remote sensing
