TI  - The potential of UAV-borne spectral and textural information for predicting aboveground biomass and N fixation in legume-grass mixtures
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - PARTIAL LEAST-SQUARES
KW  - SUPPORT VECTOR MACHINE
KW  - NITROGEN-FIXATION
