TI  - Analyzing the recovery mechanisms of patchy degradation and its response to mowing and plateau pika disturbances in alpine meadow
T2  - ECOLOGICAL INDICATORS
LA  - English
KW  - Alpine meadows
KW  - Degraded patches
KW  - Patch class
KW  - Resilience
