TI  - A UAS and Machine Learning Classification Approach to Suitability Prediction of Expanding Natural Habitats for Endangered Flora Species
T2  - REMOTE SENSING
LA  - English
KW  - nature conservation
KW  - random forest
KW  - environmental criteria
