TI  - Brandt's vole hole detection and counting method based on deep learning and unmanned aircraft system
T2  - FRONTIERS IN PLANT SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - pest rodent monitoring
KW  - vole hole detection
KW  - unmanned aerial vehicles
KW  - deep learning
