TI  - A 250 m annual alpine grassland AGB dataset over the Qinghai-Tibet Plateau (2000-2019) in China based on in situ measurements, UAV photos, and MODIS data
T2  - EARTH SYSTEM SCIENCE DATA
LA  - English
