TI  - Land Cover Classification from fused DSM and UAV Images Using Convolutional Neural Networks
T2  - REMOTE SENSING
LA  - English
KW  - land cover classification
KW  - remote sensing
KW  - GIS
KW  - UAV
KW  - Deep-Learning
KW  - fusion
