TI  - Dynamics of carbon stock and normalized difference vegetation index as indicators of oil palm (Elaeis guineensis Jacq.) productivity in peat ecosystem with compound NPK fertilizer application
T2  - JOURNAL OF ECOLOGICAL ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - carbon sequestration
KW  - Elaeis guineensis
KW  - fertilizer
