TI  - Cross-task collaborative learning for aboveground biomass estimation from UAV hyperspectral imagery in sample-scarce desert rangelands
T2  - COMPUTERS AND ELECTRONICS IN AGRICULTURE
LA  - English
KW  - Desert rangelands
KW  - Grazing
KW  - Aboveground biomass
KW  - Cross-task learning
KW  - Hyperspectral imagery
KW  - LEAF CHLOROPHYLL CONTENT
