TI  - Unmanned Aerial Vehicle-enabled grassland restoration with energy-sensitive of trajectory design and restoration areas allocation via a cooperative memetic algorithm
T2  - ENGINEERING APPLICATIONS OF ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Grassland restoration
