TI  - African Lovegrass Segmentation with Artificial Intelligence Using UAS-Based Multispectral and Hyperspectral Imagery
T2  - REMOTE SENSING
LA  - English
KW  - non-native
KW  - UAV
KW  - drone
KW  - wildfire
KW  - fire-prone
