TI  - A Novel Algorithm to Detect White Flowering Honey Trees in Mixed Forest Ecosystems Using UAV-Based RGB Imaging
T2  - AGRIENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - UAV
KW  - remote sensing
KW  - classification
