TI  - Fine-Scale Grassland Classification Using UAV-Based Multi-Sensor Image Fusion and Deep Learning
T2  - REMOTE SENSING
LA  - English
KW  - multi-source UAV data
KW  - UAV image fusion
KW  - deep convolutional networks
KW  - image semantic segmentation
KW  - attention mechanism
