TI  - Interannual spatial distribution and dynamics of large wood in a meandering river
T2  - JOURNAL OF HYDROLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - Large wood
KW  - Wood mobility
KW  - Wood storage
KW  - Meandering river
KW  - AIN RIVER
