TI  - Impacts of alpine shrub-meadow degradation on its ecosystem services and spatial patterns in Qinghai-Tibetan Plateau
T2  - ECOLOGICAL INDICATORS
LA  - English
KW  - Grassland degradation
KW  - UAV images
