TI  - Unveiling Stage Zero Conditions in the New Forest National Park: A UAV-Based Structure-From-Motion Photogrammetry and LiDAR Approach for Reconstructing an Anastomosing Wet Woodland at the Avon Water
T2  - RIVER RESEARCH AND APPLICATIONS
LA  - English
KW  - fluvial geomorphology
