TI  - Infestation dynamics of Triatoma dimidiata in highly deforested tropical dry forest regions of Guatemala
T2  - MEMORIAS DO INSTITUTO OSWALDO CRUZ
LA  - English
KW  - Chagas disease
KW  - vector control
