TI  - Fluvial architecture of the Burro Canyon Formation using unmanned aerial vehicle-based photogrammetry and outcrop-based modeling: Implications for reservoir performance, Escalante Canyon, southwestern Piceance Basin, Colorado
T2  - INTERPRETATION-A JOURNAL OF SUBSURFACE CHARACTERIZATION
LA  - English
